### Club Platform Backend — Request Collection
### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension (huachao.rest-client).
### Click "Send Request" above any block below to run it.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@supabaseUrl = https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
@anonKey = YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### --- Get a test auth token (Alice — promoted to admin) ---
# @name login
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@clubplatform.test",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}

### Search — all types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=postgres

### Search — posts only, paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=react&type=posts&page=1&limit=5

### Search — debates only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=platform&type=debates

### Search — users only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=alice&type=users

### Search — tags only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=java&type=tags

### Search — phrase syntax
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q="full-text search"&type=posts

### Search — exclusion syntax
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=transformers -career&type=posts

### Search — validation: missing q (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search

### Search — validation: invalid type (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=test&type=invalid

### --- Authenticated example (once a route needs it) ---
# Uses the token captured from the "login" request above.
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/some-protected-route
# Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
